name: sim.getObjectHierarchyOrder
description: Retrieves the zero-based position of an object among its siblings in the scene hierarchy
luaSynopsis: int order, int totalSiblingsCount = sim.getObjectHierarchyOrder(int objectHandle)
pythonSynopsis: int order, int totalSiblingsCount = sim.getObjectHierarchyOrder(int objectHandle)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: the handle of the object
outputs:
1. order: the position of the object
2. totalSiblingsCount: the total siblings count
